**DIRAC
.TITLE
 Core ionization of HCN in a bent structure
.WAVE FUNCTION
**HAMILTONIAN
.LVCORR
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELADC
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
 14
.FCKCNV
5.0E-09
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy  -2.0 1.0 0.1
*END OF

 $RELADC ADCLEVEL=3, XREPS=1, DIAGTYPE='LANC' $END
 $LANINP XNITER=500 XEVLLIM=15.0 $END



